    "https://jobs.sunderland.ac.uk/display.aspx?id=1354&pid=0": {
      "title": "Contact Us",
      "description": "Contact Us - Jobs at the University of Sunderland Skip to main content University Home Careers Home Current Vacancies Our University Our Executive/Board Our People Our Place What We Do How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Terms of Use Contact Us Cookie Information Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Contact Us Go to The University of Sunderland Close menu University Home Careers Home Current Vacancies Our University Our Executive/Board Our People Our Place What We Do How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Close Search Search Search For enquiries regarding Job Vacancies at Sunderland please contact us at: Human Resources The University of Sunderland Edinburgh Building City Campus Chester Road Sunderland SR1 3SD talent.acquisition@sunderland.ac.uk For enquiries regarding Job Vacancies at London Campus please contact us at: Human Resources University of Sunderland in London 197 Marsh Wall London E14 9SG +44 (0) 20 7531 7333 human.resources-london@sunderland.ac.uk For enquiries regarding Job Vacancies through the Graduate Internship Scheme please contact us at: 3rd Floor Edinburgh Building University of Sunderland Chester Road, Sunderland SR1 3SD internships@sunderland.ac.uk For all current Graduate Internship Vacancies, please visit our website Current Vacancies Sunderland Vacancies Graduate Internships London Vacancies Overseas Vacancies Partner Organisations Student/Graduate Opportunities Find Jobs Jobs by Email Search Jobs: Search Advanced Search Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookie Information | Accessibility"
